================================================================================
Changes in this fork
================================================================================

The new work in this fork is concentrated in a small, separable set of files:

  - src/lib/ai-harness/          natural-language <-> block two-way editing
                                 (DSL compile/decompile, edit diff/apply, LLM calls)
  - src/components/vibe-prompt/  the prompt panel UI
  - api/chat.js                  the optional free-mode proxy (serverless function)
  - a small mount in src/components/gui/gui.jsx and a dev hook in
    src/reducers/vm.js

The rest of the tree is stock scratch-gui. All additions are released under
AGPL-3.0-only, the same license as the base. A per-dependency license breakdown
is in docs/LICENSE-COMPLIANCE.md.
